# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 02_Data -- bulk crawl data
#
# The previous blanket rule "02_data/*" excluded the whole directory (it
# matched case-insensitively on Windows), so none of the dataset was tracked.
# Large raw exports are excluded individually below; the small files the claim
# scripts need are tracked in Git, which lets Claims 2 and 3 run straight from
# a clone without downloading anything.
#
# Everything excluded here is published in the Zenodo dataset record instead;
# see docs/provenance.md and install.sh.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Raw per-profile cookie/script joins (~23 GB)
02_Data/potential_tracking_cookies/
02_Data/potential_first_party_tracking_cookies/

# Full per-profile ecosystem exports (~105 GB)
02_Data/ecosystem/full_data/

# Cluster payloads for the network-graph figures (~3.8 GB)
02_Data/ecosystem/network_graph/

# Page-breakage screenshots (~12 GB)
02_Data/pbdata/

# Per-profile content_hash -> simhash maps (113-166 MB each; above GitHub's
# 100 MB per-file limit). Only consumed by the upstream extraction stage,
# which additionally needs the raw PostgreSQL crawl database.
02_Data/js_hashes/EU1_hashes.csv
02_Data/js_hashes/EU2_hashes.csv
02_Data/js_hashes/US1_hashes.csv
02_Data/js_hashes/US2_hashes.csv
02_Data/js_hashes/benchmarks/

02_Data/model_data/

.claude
